[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-oando-green-youth-upskilling-program-gyup-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity-168":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},168,"oando-green-youth-upskilling-program-gyup-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity-168","Oando Green Youth Upskilling Program (gyup) 2026 For Nigerians: Career Opportunity","\u003Cp>Grow your career in technology via the Oando Green Youth Upskilling Program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Oando Foundation is inviting applications from young Nigerians interested in career development through green economy to apply for the Green Youth Upskilling Program (GYUP).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Oando Green Youth Upskilling Program Abstrac\u003C\u002Fstrong>t\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Oando Foundation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Sponsorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to Funding\u002FGrants\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Oando Foundation Green Youth Upskilling Program (GYUP) Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Green Youth Upskilling Program (GYUP) is a forward-looking initiative powered by The Oando Foundation, with NCIC as the key implementing partner.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Oando Foundation GYUP 2026 is designed to prepare young Nigerians for emerging opportunities in the green economy.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As climate change and environmental challenges reshape the global workforce, this program equips youth with practical, future-focused skills that promote sustainability, innovation, and economic inclusion.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Oando Foundation GYUP 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Participants of the Oando Foundation GYUP 2026 get;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training in green skills such as renewable energy, recycling innovation, sustainable farming, and climate tech.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to mentors and ecosystem leaders.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Grant opportunities to launch green ventures.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visibility and support to grow their solutions.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Community and peer networking with other green youth leaders.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Oando Green Youth Upskilling Program (GYUP) Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Oando Green Youth Upskilling Program (GYUP), applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a Nigerian citizen within the specified age bracket.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have completed at least secondary education (SSCE).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrate a strong interest in green and technical fields.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be fully available to participate in the program, including all virtual or physical sessions.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit a complete application with all required documents before the deadline.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>(Optional but advantageous): Have exposure to green or technical work through volunteering, self-learning, internships, or informal jobs.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a Nigerian between the ages of \u003Cstrong>20\u003C\u002Fstrong>–35 years old.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents for Oando Foundation Green Youth Upskilling Program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Oando Foundation Green Youth Upskilling Program, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A completed application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A recent CV or one-page biography\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A statement of interest (max 300 words) detailing:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Why you want to be part of the Green Youth Upskilling Program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Any exposure to green\u002Ftechnical work (formal or informal)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your career aspirations after completing the training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Optional supporting materials such as photos, reference letters, or certificates to demonstrate passion and initiative.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for Oando Green Youth Upskilling Program (GYUP) 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Oando Green Youth Upskilling Program (GYUP), follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgyup.net\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fgyup.net\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-22 10:23:13",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u00